{"video":"19ulSNSRKyU","lines":[{"t":[0.4,5],"en":"Presents are the best way to show someone how much you care."},{"t":[5,9.9],"en":"It is like this tangible thing that you can point to and say, \"Hey, man, I love you."},{"t":[9.9,12],"en":"This many dollars worth.\""},{"t":[12,13],"en":"First present."},{"t":[13,14],"en":"Oscar."},{"t":[14,18.7],"en":"Shower radio, neat."},{"t":[18.7,19.7],"en":"Oh, great."},{"t":[19.7,20.7],"en":"That was for me."},{"t":[20.7,21.7],"en":"Thanks, Kelly."},{"t":[21.7,22.7],"en":"You know I was gonna get one of these."},{"t":[22.7,23.7],"en":"Okay, okay."},{"t":[23.7,24.7],"en":"That's enough."},{"t":[24.7,25.7],"en":"Let's keep it moving on."},{"t":[25.7,26.7],"en":"Jim."},{"t":[26.7,27.7],"en":"Oh, cool."},{"t":[27.7,32.7],"en":"That's for me."},{"t":[32.7,33.7],"en":"Great."},{"t":[33.7,35.7],"en":"Where'd you get it?"},{"t":[35.7,36.7],"en":"I don't know."},{"t":[36.7,38.1],"en":"It was so long ago."},{"t":[38.1,42.4],"en":"He obviously forgot to get me something, and then he went into his closet and dug out this"},{"t":[42.4,45.4],"en":"little number and then threw it in a bag."},{"t":[45.4,46.4],"en":"Yep."},{"t":[46.4,47.4],"en":"That's exactly what happened."},{"t":[47.4,48.4],"en":"Pam."},{"t":[48.4,50.4],"en":"Oh, my God!"},{"t":[50.4,62.4],"en":"Thank you very much, Santa, whoever you are."},{"t":[62.4,63.4],"en":"It's awesome."},{"t":[63.4,64.4],"en":"There's a little more to it."},{"t":[64.4,65.4],"en":"All right."},{"t":[65.4,66.4],"en":"Next."},{"t":[66.4,67.4],"en":"Brian."},{"t":[74.4,75.4],"en":"Whoa."},{"t":[75.4,76.4],"en":"Video iPod."},{"t":[76.4,77.4],"en":"Whoa."},{"t":[77.4,78.4],"en":"Wow."},{"t":[78.4,79.4],"en":"Geez."},{"t":[79.4,80.4],"en":"Somebody really got carried away with this."},{"t":[80.4,81.4],"en":"Spirit of Christmas."},{"t":[81.4,82.4],"en":"It was me."},{"t":[82.4,84.4],"en":"I got carried away with the spirit."},{"t":[84.4,87.5],"en":"Wasn't there a $20 limit on the gift?"},{"t":[87.5,89.5],"en":"This is $400."},{"t":[89.5,90.5],"en":"You don't know that."},{"t":[90.5,91.5],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[91.5,92.5],"en":"You left the price tag on."},{"t":[92.5,93.5],"en":"I did?"},{"t":[93.5,94.5],"en":"What?"},{"t":[94.5,95.5],"en":"Oh, shoot."},{"t":[95.5,96.5],"en":"Wow."},{"t":[96.5,97.5],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[97.5,98.5],"en":"Well."},{"t":[98.5,99.5],"en":"Who cares?"},{"t":[99.5,100.5],"en":"Doesn't matter what I spent."},{"t":[100.5,102.5],"en":"What matters is that Christmas is fun, right?"},{"t":[102.5,103.5],"en":"Michael."},{"t":[103.5,104.5],"en":"Oh, hey."},{"t":[104.5,106.5],"en":"For me."},{"t":[106.5,109.5],"en":"What is in here?"},{"t":[109.5,112.5],"en":"Oh, come on."},{"t":[112.5,114.5],"en":"I knitted it for you."},{"t":[114.5,116.5],"en":"An oven mitt?"},{"t":[116.5,117.5],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[117.5,123.5],"en":"So Phyllis is basically saying, hey, Michael, I know you did a lot to help the office this"},{"t":[123.5,127.5],"en":"year, but I only care about you a homemade oven mitt's worth."},{"t":[127.5,130.5],"en":"I gave Ryan an iPod."},{"t":[130.5,136.5],"en":"Um, should we just keep opening up the presents?"},{"t":[136.5,140.5],"en":"We don't do anything until Michael gives us further instructions."},{"t":[140.5,145.5],"en":"I got it."},{"t":[145.5,151.5],"en":"We are going to turn Secret Santa into Yankee Swap."},{"t":[151.5,152.5],"en":"What is Yankee Swap?"},{"t":[152.5,155.5],"en":"One person chooses a gift."},{"t":[155.5,160.5],"en":"The next person can either choose a gift or steal that person's gift."},{"t":[160.5,165.5],"en":"If your gift gets stolen, then you can steal someone else's gift or choose a new gift."},{"t":[165.5,166.5],"en":"I thought that was called Nasty Christmas."},{"t":[166.5,168.5],"en":"Yeah, we call it White Elephant."},{"t":[168.5,171.5],"en":"Well, I call it fun."},{"t":[171.5,172.5],"en":"Why are we doing this?"},{"t":[172.5,173.5],"en":"Because it's better."},{"t":[173.5,174.5],"en":"Because it's more special."},{"t":[174.5,175.5],"en":"It sounds mean."},{"t":[175.5,176.5],"en":"Shut it."},{"t":[176.5,177.5],"en":"No."},{"t":[177.5,178.5],"en":"It's not."},{"t":[178.5,179.5],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[179.5,180.5],"en":"Just give it a shot."},{"t":[180.5,182.5],"en":"Michael should have asked the party planning committee first."},{"t":[182.5,184.5],"en":"He's not supposed to just spring things on us out of nowhere."},{"t":[184.5,185.5],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[185.5,189.5],"en":"Meredith is up first."},{"t":[189.5,190.5],"en":"Here's the deal."},{"t":[190.5,200.5],"en":"You can either pick a new gift or you can steal somebody else's gift they've already gotten like the oven mitt."},{"t":[200.5,202.5],"en":"I'll take the teapot."},{"t":[202.5,203.5],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[203.5,204.5],"en":"Shouldn't we?"},{"t":[204.5,206.5],"en":"I bought that specifically for Pam."},{"t":[206.5,207.5],"en":"Yay!"},{"t":[207.5,208.5],"en":"Can't swap!"},{"t":[208.5,209.5],"en":"That's what makes it fun."},{"t":[209.5,211.5],"en":"Pam, you can steal the oven mitt now."},{"t":[211.5,212.5],"en":"I'll take the iPod."},{"t":[212.5,213.5],"en":"And I have to give it to her."},{"t":[213.5,214.5],"en":"I don't have a choice."},{"t":[214.5,215.5],"en":"Yes."},{"t":[215.5,220.5],"en":"Now you can steal the oven mitt, the old shirt, or the shower, radio, or pick a new gift."},{"t":[230.5,233.5],"en":"That was meant for Kelly."},{"t":[233.5,235.5],"en":"Yeah, I figured."}]}
